        "collapsible_tab_7BbcT4": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Frequently asked questions",
            "icon": "none",
            "content": "<p><strong>Q: What if my dog doesn't like the chews?</strong><br/>A: In the rare case that this happens, we’ll issue a full refund.<br/><br/><strong>Q: How long until I start seeing the benefits?</strong><br/>A: Most dog owners notice improvements within 4–6 weeks, such as less paw licking, reduced scratching, or better digestion.</p><p>For full benefits like healthier skin, a shinier coat, and more energy, give the chews for at least 6 to 8 weeks. <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Consistency</span> is key!<br/><br/><strong>Q: At what age can my dog start using these?</strong><br/>A: Our chews are suitable for dogs of all ages and breeds. We recommend introducing it into your dog’s daily routine starting from 3 months of age.</p><p></p>",
            "page": "",
            "collapsible_tab_style": "default",
            "custom_liquid": ""
          }
